      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01123",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "这本书是哲学家马咯专门给我带过来的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This book was brought to me specially by the philosopher Mago.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01123",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "请你朗诵第一首诗。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Please recite the first poem.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01123",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "哦，你看不懂得河童文字。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Oh, you cannot read kappa writing.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01123",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "我读给你听吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I will read it aloud for you.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01123",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "这是最近出版的《托喀全集》里面的一本。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This is one volume from the recently published Complete Works of Tokka.",
          "g": "predicate"
